{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/jelastic/mysql","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:19:58.955Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/jelastic/mysql/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/jelastic/mysql"},"readme":"_An image of the MySQL database server with preconfigured resource optimization due to the load, inbuilt web admin panel, automated access restoration option, as well as regular updates and security patches maintained by Jelastic PaaS._\n\nThis MySQL image is specifically designed for running as an isolated container within [Jelastic PaaS](http://jelastic.com/). By using this managed dockerized template, you get:\n* regular updates to the latest versions and security patches maintained by Jelastic team\n* automatic tuning and optimization of configurations according to the load and available resources\n* database password reset option\n* inbuilt web UI for database admin panel\n* full compatibility with Jelastic UI for easy management\n\n[Follow the guide to install managed container](https://docs.jelastic.com/setting-up-environment) with the required stack in Jelastic PaaS.\n\nAlso, this image can be forked, changed and [installed as a custom container](https://docs.jelastic.com/dockers-management) within a platform.\n\nLearn more about [database cloud hosting](https://docs.jelastic.com/database-hosting) in Jelastic PaaS.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"jelastic","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/jelastic","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2017-03-12T15:02:30.345977Z","updated":"2026-09-24T11:50:08.712532Z","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":10208436,"stars":4},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":38533771397,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":null,"pushed":"2020-08-26T14:06:46.909372Z","size":549034067,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.conta